  "Spooky Pie": {"slug":"spooky-pie","desc":"Scares your crops into · dropping everything!","note":"How to frighten your crops with a Spooky Pie: · Plant 4 individual seeds (4 of a single type, 4 different types, or mix it up) Activate your pie by going to the item details for the Spooky Pie and hit 'Use this item' Harvest each of your 4 crops when they are finished growing, or after using a grape juice Receive each of the 4 harvested crops and any other items the individual crop can produce (gold crops, runestones, etc) · EXAMPLE: If you plant a carrot, when you harvest the carrot you would receive an extra carrot, a gold carrot and Runestone 01, guaranteed! This pie works with any crop, but it does not work with cookies. · IMPORTANT: Be very careful in using this item and think about what seeds you are planting and harvesting! Once used, it cannot be undone or refunded. · ONE MORE THING: It is best to plant crops one by one, so if you are using 'condensed view' in your Farm, you can go back to 'full' view under Farm Settings."},
